# ==================================================
# PENTING: File berikut HARUS ada untuk Streamlit Cloud
# JANGAN uncomment baris di bawah ini!
# ==================================================
# app.py              - Aplikasi Streamlit
# requirements.txt    - Dependencies
# data.json           - Dataset intents
# ketara_chatbot.keras - Model trained
# tokenizer.pkl       - Tokenizer
# label_encoder.pkl   - Label encoder
# responses.pkl       - Responses dictionary
# config.pkl          - Model config
